[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11704.07, "timestamp": "03:15:04", "text": "GPU 性能太低，比如 1660 Super，我无法使用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11706.87, "timestamp": "03:15:06", "text": "使用太多设备后，我玩不了好游戏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11707.95, "timestamp": "03:15:07", "text": "东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11712.67, "timestamp": "03:15:12", "text": "我之前的电脑配备的是一块2060显卡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11716.429, "timestamp": "03:15:16", "text": "我之前有一张 RTX 2060 显卡，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11720.19, "timestamp": "03:15:20", "text": "显卡坏了。如果那样行不通"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11723.67, "timestamp": "03:15:23", "text": "不再是了。还有那台老式游戏电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11727.469, "timestamp": "03:15:27", "text": "其中之一是AMD的Ryzen 7"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11731.75, "timestamp": "03:15:31", "text": "3800X。那台CPU也坏了。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11734.11, "timestamp": "03:15:34", "text": "在职的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11737.75, "timestamp": "03:15:37", "text": "不再是了。是的。所以当我去日本的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11740.87, "timestamp": "03:15:40", "text": "七月份我得买一台新笔记本电脑。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11743.59, "timestamp": "03:15:43", "text": "这台电脑无法使用。不，这台电脑将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11745.11, "timestamp": "03:15:45", "text": "在印度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11747.95, "timestamp": "03:15:47", "text": "我会在家。"}]